# Crownless Saga: a turn-based party RPG invented as a genre example. No game's names, data or
# logic. A hero gathers companions and key items across four towns and the wilds between
# them, then storms the keep at the end. Shop shelves are locations. Areas that a party would
# have to grind levels for are gated by a progression item, `veteran_rank`, that stands for
# those levels.
world crownless_saga "Crownless Saga" version 1
use items
use logic
use regions/towns
use regions/wilds
use regions/dungeons
start millbrook

# Shelves per town shop that hold a randomized item.
option shop_slots: range 1..5 = 3
# On, shops never hold progression, so a player never has to buy the key to the next area.
option safe_shops: toggle = on
# Companions that must have joined before the keep opens.
option party_needed: range 1..4 = 3

goal crown_reclaimed
